  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Multiple countries &#x2013; Strategy Days</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to improve the quality and effective execution of Orange Corners programmes, by creating a community of practice of local service providers.In a five-day programme, local service providers, local embassy staff, and local private partners, will consolidate together with the Orange Corners&apos; headquarter team and policy makers to reflect, improve, and plan the future of Orange Corners.</narrative>
  </description>
